                "characterPrompts": [
                  {
                    "label": "char1",
                    "prompt": "male, brown hair, short hair, buzz cut, amber eyes, muscular male, broad shoulders, tall, facial stubble, open-faced iron barbute helmet, dented iron breastplate with heavy pauldrons, jointed iron tassets and armored greaves, chainmail chausses, iron sabatons, standing, legs apart, grimace, clenched butt, teeth, looking ahead, blood on face, sweat, shield, bruise on shoulder, bleeding on arm\nA massive, hulking warrior with an immense broad-shouldered build, weathered rugged face with stubble, and close-cropped brown hair, exuding the endurance of a living fortress. Standing like an immovable bastion in the narrow canyon throat, planted behind an immense steel tower shield dug deep into the stone. Bracing hard with legs wide apart, massive shoulder pressed firmly into the back of his colossal tower shield while raising a heavy flanged mace. Enduring the ferocious assault of spears and axes against his shield, teeth clenched as steam rises from his armor."
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "char2",
